      "doc": "One radio option inside `[forMenuRadioGroup]`. Click and Enter set the group's `value` to this item's `value`, emit `(select)`, and close the menu — call `event.preventDefault()` on the emitted event to keep the menu open. Per APG, **Space** sets the value and emits `(select)` without closing the menu.",
      "source": "menu/menu-radio-item.ts",
